 {'explanation': 'Austria saw approximately 2.5 GW of new PV capacity in 2023, over double the 1 GW installed in 2022, aligning with or surpassing the identified average annual expansion path toward long-term targets. [Data: Entities 12, 13, 163; Relationships 11, 13, 186]', 'summary': 'PV deployment by 2023 reached record levels in Austria, matching or exceeding planned average expansion rates.'}
