            "summary": "The strategic focus includes optimizing PV planning across technical, economic, regulatory, and social dimensions, as well as orienting national actions with broader EU research initiatives.",
            "explanation": "The strategy recommends optimal, holistic PV planning and alignment or orientation with the European Research Framework Programme to reinforce the national and EU business site, described as a recommendation rather than an implemented reality. [Data: Entities 498, 88; Relationships 599, 97]"
        }
    ],
    "rating": 9.0,
    "rating_explanation": "This community contains comprehensive, directly sourced information relevant to multiple aspects of Austria’s solar-market policy, targets, stakeholders, and infrastructure, each supported by explicit data references."
}

